      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. i was thinking tho, some people might argue that the \"march of progress\" wasn't really progress for everyone, especially the tribes that were already there. should we add a section about the displacement of indigenous people, or would that ruin the inspiring tone of the exhibit?",
